{"id":"contigo","lemma":"contigo","pos":"adv","rank":171,"glosses":["with you (singular)","with yourself"],"ipa":"/konˈtiɡo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-contigo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién ha venido contigo?","en":"Who came with you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823862"},{"text":"Trae a Tom contigo.","en":"Bring Tom with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799514"},{"text":"No puedo ir contigo.","en":"I can't go with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449224"},{"text":"Podemos contar contigo Tom.","en":"We can count on Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800824"},{"text":"¿El libro está contigo?","en":"Do you have the book?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800829"}]}